  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPIDER</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SPIDER</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPIDER is a Swedish resource center for Information and Communication Technology for Development (ICT4D). It is a Swedish network of ICT    expertise with partners primarily from the private sector and         universities. The SPIDER center acts as a node for networking and     coordinates with other ICT actors in Sweden working with ICT4D.       SPIDER is located at DSV/Stockholm university in Kista.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SPIDER &#xe4;r ett svenskt resurscentrum f&#xf6;r informations-och              kommunikationsteknik f&#xf6;r utveckling (ICT4D). Det &#xe4;r ett svenskt       n&#xe4;tverk inom IT med partners fr&#xe4;mst fr&#xe5;n den privata sektorn och      universiteten. SPIDERs centrum fungerar som en nod f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;tverk och    koordinater med andra IKT akt&#xf6;rer i Sverige som arbetar med ICT4D.    SPIDER ligger p&#xe5; DSV / Stockholms universitet i Kista</narrative>
  </description>
